      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Device:\n\nAQUOS sense10\n\nOS:\n\nAndroid 16\n\nIssue started:\n\nAround June 1, 2026\n\nSymptoms:\n\nThumbnail images, avatar images, event banners and print camera images are displayed with yellow noise/corruption.\n\nThe issue only occurs in VRChat Mobile.\n\nUI elements, loading screens and most text render normally.\n\nTroubleshooting already performed:\n\n- Cleared cache\n\n- Reinstalled VRChat\n\n- Confirmed latest app version\n\n- More than 100 GB free storage\n\n- Tested both Wi-Fi and mobile data\n\n- Disabled HW overlays in Android developer options",
